  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Renamed all Csharp prefixes to CSharp (CsharpProjectAnalysis → CSharpProjectAnalysis, CsharpRegex → CSharpRegex, etc.)\n- Extracted BaseAnalysis base class from CSharpProjectAnalysis for shared MSBuild workspace logic\n- Added CSharpSolutionAnalysis for loading and analyzing full .sln solutions\n- Added shebang directive (#!) support to FileBasedAppEvaluator\n- Added string-based IsFileBasedApp overload for evaluating C# text without file I/O\n- Added FileBasedDirectiveType enum for classifying directives (Package, Property, Sdk, Project)\n- Added FileBasedAppWrapper for parsing and inspecting file-based app directives\n- Added IgnoredDirectiveWrapper for extracting typed directive info from Roslyn trivia\n- Added PackageDirectiveWrapper with Update method for modifying package directives in-place\n- Added PackageInfo record for parsing package name and version from directives",
